# Kabadiwala AI Service

AI-powered scrap material recognition service developed for the Kabadiwala recycling platform.

## Team Responsibility

Team Member #4 – AI/ML

## Technologies Used

- Python
- YOLO11n
- Ultralytics
- FastAPI
- Uvicorn
- PyTorch

## Supported Materials

The model is trained to recognize:

- Paper
- Plastic
- Glass
- Metal
- Organic
- Electronics
- Miscellaneous

